      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멋진 풍경이지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA4BC9C40020D48DACBDC774C9C0003F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여러 지방을 여행해 왔지만\n미르의 스카이라인을 감상할 수 있는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이 거리 풍경은 정말 각별하다고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECB7EC0020C9C0BC29C7440020C5ECD589D5740020C654C9C0B9CC000ABBF8B974C7580020C2A4CE74C774B77CC778C7440020AC10C0C1D5600020C2180020C788B29400100001BE00000AC7740020AC70B9AC0020D48DACBDC7400020C815B9D00020AC01BCC4D558B2E4ACE0002E00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나랑 조금 특이한\n포켓몬 승부를 해 보지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B7910020C870AE080020D2B9C774D55C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5740020BCF4C9C00020C54AC744B798003F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "서로 비행타입 포켓몬만으로\n싸우는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C11CB85C0020BE44D589D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACB9CCC73CB85C000AC2F8C6B0B2940020AC70C57C002E00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬은 1마리든 여러 마리든 괜찮아.\n어때? 한번 해 볼래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC74000200031B9C8B9ACB4E00020C5ECB7EC0020B9C8B9ACB4E00020AD1CCC2EC544002E000AC5B4B54C003F0020D55CBC880020D5740020BCFCB798003F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비행타입 포켓몬만으로\n싸울 준비가 되었다면 내게 말을 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44D589D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACB9CCC73CB85C000AC2F8C6B80020C900BE44AC000020B418C5C8B2E4BA740020B0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비행타입을 가진 포켓몬만\n지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 승부해 보지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44D589D0C0C785C7440020AC00C9C40020D3ECCF13BAACB9CC000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE00020C2B9BD80D5740020BCF4C9C00020C54AC744B798003F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오! 비행타입을 가진 포켓몬만 데려왔구나!\n그럼, 포켓몬 승부를 시작할까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C62400210020BE44D589D0C0C785C7440020AC00C9C40020D3ECCF13BAACB9CC0020B370B824C654AD6CB0980021000AADF8B7FC002C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D560AE4C003F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부에 내보낼 포켓몬을\n다시 검토해 보려고?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80C5D00020B0B4BCF4B0BC0020D3ECCF13BAACC744000AB2E4C2DC0020AC80D1A0D5740020BCF4B824ACE0003F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누구의 포켓몬이 하늘을 지배할지\n확인해 볼까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204AD6CC7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020D558B298C7440020C9C0BC30D560C9C0000AD655C778D5740020BCFCAE4C002100100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비행타입만으로도 이렇게 강력하다니!\n마치 스카이 트레이너 같은걸!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44D589D0C0C785B9CCC73CB85CB3C40020C774B807AC8C0020AC15B825D558B2E4B2C80021000AB9C8CE580020C2A4CE74C7740020D2B8B808C774B1080020AC19C740AC78002100100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스카이배틀이라는 게\n한때 칼로스지방에서 유행했었어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4CE74C774BC30D2C0C774B77CB2940020AC8C000AD55CB54C0020CE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C5D0C11C0020C720D589D588C5C8C5B4002E00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하늘을 날 수 있는 포켓몬과\n공중에 떠 있는 포켓몬만으로 싸우는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬 승부였지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558B298C7440020B0A00020C2180020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAACACFC000AACF5C911C5D00020B5A00020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAACB9CCC73CB85C0020C2F8C6B0B29400100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80C600C9C0002E00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너 정도 실력이면 분명\n스카이배틀의 최강자도 될 수 있을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B1080020C815B3C40020C2E4B825C774BA740020BD84BA85000AC2A4CE74C774BC30D2C0C7580020CD5CAC15C790B3C40020B4200020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C57C002100100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇게 되면 스카이배틀도\n다시 크게 유행하지 않을까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AC8C0020B418BA740020C2A4CE74C774BC30D2C0B3C4000AB2E4C2DC0020D06CAC8C0020C720D589D558C9C00020C54AC744AE4C002100100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너 정도 실력이면 분명\n스카이배틀의 최강자도 될 수 있을 거야!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그렇게 되면 스카이배틀도\n다시 크게 유행하지 않을까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
